{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 70,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        83.1881103515625,
        510.6430358886719,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "Many risk factors are responsible for the nosocomial spread of TB in high-burden",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        99.18463134765625,
        271.18988037109375,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "settings. The most easily rectified are:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        121.49212646484375,
        314.4943542480469,
        134.95863342285156
      ],
      "text": "lack of simple administrative measures;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        140.96142578125,
        398.8814697265625,
        154.4279327392578
      ],
      "text": "poor ventilation due to inappropriate design of facilities;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        160.43060302734375,
        510.5810241699219,
        173.89710998535156
      ],
      "text": "high patient loads resulting in long waiting times and crowded wards and  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        120.4894027709961,
        174.82861328125,
        206.7393798828125,
        188.18011474609375
      ],
      "text": "outpatient clinics.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        196.49462890625,
        510.5579833984375,
        209.84613037109375
      ],
      "text": "Other factors that may play a role in nosocomial TB transmission but that are more",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        212.49114990234375,
        216.8938751220703,
        225.8426513671875
      ],
      "text": "difficult to address include:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        234.8038330078125,
        284.29541015625,
        248.2703399658203
      ],
      "text": "poor adherence to TB treatment;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        254.27313232421875,
        251.2559051513672,
        267.7396240234375
      ],
      "text": "weak health care systems;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        273.742431640625,
        371.1779479980469,
        287.20892333984375
      ],
      "text": "lack of scale-up of implementation of ART and IPT;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        293.21173095703125,
        269.60986328125,
        306.67822265625
      ],
      "text": "shortage of human resources;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        312.6810302734375,
        313.26385498046875,
        326.14752197265625
      ],
      "text": "inadequate education of staff by NTPs;  -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        332.1502990722656,
        309.65289306640625,
        345.6167907714844
      ],
      "text": "inadequate understanding by patients; -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.63939666748047,
        352.2195129394531,
        254.01588439941406,
        365.6860046386719
      ],
      "text": "poverty and stigmatization. -",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        373.885498046875,
        510.5351867675781,
        387.23699951171875
      ],
      "text": "In TB-endemic settings, in addition to the risk of living in a household with an infectious",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        389.8819885253906,
        510.6041259765625,
        403.2334899902344
      ],
      "text": "case of TB, there is a risk of TB transmission to children who attend health facilities.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        405.87847900390625,
        510.60400390625,
        419.22998046875
      ],
      "text": "The risk of developing TB following infection is particularly high for infants and young",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        421.8749694824219,
        510.5464172363281,
        435.2264709472656
      ],
      "text": "children and for children of any age living with HIV who accompany their parents or",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        437.8714599609375,
        510.5809631347656,
        451.22296142578125
      ],
      "text": "guardians on visits to health facilities. People with presumptive TB should never share",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        453.8679504394531,
        510.6155700683594,
        467.2194519042969
      ],
      "text": "a waiting area with immune-compromised children, for example infants attending",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        469.86444091796875,
        510.6500244140625,
        483.2159423828125
      ],
      "text": "for immunizations or well-baby checks, or children at HIV clinics. All children with",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        485.8609313964844,
        510.6385803222656,
        499.2124328613281
      ],
      "text": "cavitary or sputum smear-positive TB disease should be isolated. The risk of exposure is",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        501.857421875,
        510.54656982421875,
        515.2089233398438
      ],
      "text": "particularly high in facilities that care for adults with TB and/or HIV. TB is the commonest",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        517.8539428710938,
        487.4084777832031,
        531.2054443359375
      ],
      "text": "opportunistic infection in adults living with HIV and of childbearing/parenting age.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        542.3604125976562,
        510.59246826171875,
        555.7119140625
      ],
      "text": "Children with TB are often considered not to be infectious and therefore not likely to",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        558.3568725585938,
        510.6271057128906,
        571.7083740234375
      ],
      "text": "transmit TB. However, some children do transmit TB, and infection control is therefore",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        574.3533935546875,
        510.56939697265625,
        587.7048950195312
      ],
      "text": "important even in health facilities or areas dedicated solely to the management of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        590.3499145507812,
        510.5926818847656,
        603.701416015625
      ],
      "text": "sick children. Moreover, there is a high risk of unsuspected and untreated TB disease",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03490447998047,
        606.2774047851562,
        510.5809326171875,
        619.6978759765625
      ],
      "text": "(26, 27) among adults who are accompanying or visiting such children  . The clinical",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.034912109375,
        622.3428955078125,
        510.53497314453125,
        635.6943969726562
      ],
      "text": "presentation of TB in children is variable and often overlaps with the presentation of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.034912109375,
        638.3394165039062,
        510.58087158203125,
        651.69091796875
      ],
      "text": "pneumonia, HIV and malnutrition; thus, infection control measures are relevant to all",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.034912109375,
        654.3359375,
        376.8589172363281,
        667.6874389648438
      ],
      "text": "outpatient and inpatient areas where sick children are seen.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.034912109375,
        678.8424072265625,
        236.23692321777344,
        692.1939086914062
      ],
      "text": "Particular areas of concern are:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        703.400634765625,
        510.5655517578125,
        716.7521362304688
      ],
      "text": "Newborn care settings. There are many documented outbreaks of TB among",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        707.072509765625,
        91.36740112304688,
        715.072509765625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        719.3970947265625,
        510.623046875,
        732.7485961914062
      ],
      "text": "neonates with the source usually being a mother or a member of staff who may",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        735.3936157226562,
        510.6346130371094,
        748.7451171875
      ],
      "text": "infect many babies in the neonatal care unit. Neonates are particularly vulnerable",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        751.39013671875,
        415.2075500488281,
        764.7416381835938
      ],
      "text": "for acute onset or development of disseminated severe disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        773.400634765625,
        510.5885925292969,
        786.7521362304688
      ],
      "text": "Health facilities that provide care for adults, older children and adolescents with TB,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        777.072509765625,
        91.36740112304688,
        785.072509765625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        789.3970947265625,
        227.9989776611328,
        802.7485961914062
      ],
      "text": "who are often infectious.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        558.6439208984375,
        805.8439331054688,
        580.8839111328125,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "51",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}